<section id="momentum-liquidity">
  <h2>5. Momentum Dynamics & Liquidity Behavior</h2>

  <h3>Moving Average Crossover Signals</h3>
  <p>We evaluate a simple 50-day / 200-day moving-average crossover as a proxy for trend-following momentum. Gold has been in a "bull regime" (MA50 &gt; MA200) for <strong>70.8%</strong> of the dataset — consistent with its secular uptrend.</p>

